          <td>Code, third step</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Visual adaptation</th>
          <td>Designer or studio</td>
          <td>Layouts, on-image text and imagery rebuilt around the chosen option</td>
          <td>The target copy does not fit the space the source left</td>
          <td>Production practice</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Review</th>
          <td>Client comments; transcreator amends</td>
          <td>Agreed feedback rounds, plus any agency quality check on its own grid</td>
          <td>Copy and visual comments arrive on separate threads</td>
          <td>Code, fourth step; ISO 5060:2024 for evaluation</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Compliance check</th>
          <td>Producer, with the client's legal reviewer</td>
          <td>Copy and visuals checked against each market's advertising and labeling rules</td>
